# Search scope for agents and ripgrep-style tools.
#
# ripgrep already honours .gitignore, but a plain `grep -r` does not, and these
# directories hold hundreds of megabytes of generated or runtime output that
# would otherwise drown a code search. Keep this list in step with .gitignore.
logs/
node_modules/
release/
dist-node/
dist-electron/
coverage/
test-results/
.ui-check/
.pi/
